      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "it seems this is a Proton issue due to poor Media Foundation support; the way VRChat accesses the camera is simply not supported?\n\nsomeone is working on implementing the appropriate support on Proton's Issue for VRChat - https://github.com/ValveSoftware/Proton/issues/1199#issuecomment-3981022802",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
